    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a gyro-only game. Please make sure that your controller is equipped with a gyro function before purchasing.<br>The Xbox controller cannot be used for this game because it does not have a gyro function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play the trial version first to check the operation of the controller.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation-confirmed controllers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DualSense, DUALSHOCK 4, Nintendo Switch Pro Controller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll around with the gyro control! Overcome numerous gimmicks to reach the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korokoro is a gyro-only casual game. A total of 50 stages. Tilt and roll 5 balls of different shapes to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing the &quot;Normal Mode&quot; first, which is quite challenging after 30 stages. &quot;Reverse mode&quot; reverses the controller controls. &quot;Survival Mode&quot; is a 10-stage continuous play mode for advanced players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Normal Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 50 stages</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reverse mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 stages as in Normal Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gyro control reversed mode</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-stage continuous play mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage design is the same as Normal Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and don't rush. Don't get frustrated if you make a mistake. Accuracy over speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Submission and Live Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and corporations can distribute their own videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through distribution services (spacha, etc.) is also not a problem.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a gyro-only game. Please make sure that your controller is equipped with a gyro function before purchasing.<br>The Xbox controller cannot be used for this game because it does not have a gyro function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play the trial version first to check the operation of the controller.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation-confirmed controllers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DualSense, DUALSHOCK 4, Nintendo Switch Pro Controller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll around with the gyro control! Overcome numerous gimmicks to reach the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korokoro is a gyro-only casual game. A total of 50 stages. Tilt and roll 5 balls of different shapes to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing the &quot;Normal Mode&quot; first, which is quite challenging after 30 stages. &quot;Reverse mode&quot; reverses the controller controls. &quot;Survival Mode&quot; is a 10-stage continuous play mode for advanced players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Normal Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 50 stages</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reverse mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 stages as in Normal Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gyro control reversed mode</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-stage continuous play mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage design is the same as Normal Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips of the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and don't rush. Don't get frustrated if you make a mistake. Accuracy over speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Submission and Live Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and corporations can distribute their own videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization through distribution services (spacha, etc.) is also not a problem.</p>",
